        "These steps follow the Hanafi method. In the Shafi‘i school: the hands are folded above the navel; the opening dua is ‘Wajjahtu wajhiya…’; Bismillah is recited as part of al-Fatihah and Ameen is said aloud in the loud prayers; the hands are raised when going into ruku‘ and when rising from it; the follower also recites al-Fatihah; and Qunut is read in Fajr after the ruku‘ of the second rak‘ah. Learn the details from a teacher of your school." to "Bu qadamlar Hanafiy usuliga amal qiladi. Shofi'iy mazhabida: qo'llar kindikdan yuqorida buklangan; ochilish duosi “Vajjahtu vajhiya…”; “Fotiha” surasida “Bismillah” o‘qiladi va baland ovozda o‘qiladigan duolarda “Omin” aytiladi; rukuga kirganda va undan ko'tarilganda qo'llar ko'tariladi; ergashuvchi ham Fotiha surasini o'qiydi; Qunut esa bomdodda ikkinchi rak'at ruku'sidan keyin o'qiladi. Tafsilotlarni maktabingiz o'qituvchisidan bilib oling.",
        "These steps follow the Hanafi method. In the Maliki school: the arms are commonly left at the sides; no opening dua, Ta‘awwuz or Bismillah is recited in a Fard prayer; the follower does not recite behind the imam in the loud prayers; Qunut is read quietly in Fajr; and the prayer is ended with one obligatory salam. Learn the details from a teacher of your school." to "Bu qadamlar Hanafiy usuliga amal qiladi. Molikiy mazhabida: qo'llar odatda yon tomonlarda qoldiriladi; Farz namozida ochilish duosi, taavuz yoki bismilloh aytilmaydi; baland ovozda o'qiladigan namozlarda imom orqasida o'qimaydi; Qunut bomdodda jimgina o‘qiladi; va namoz bir farz salom bilan yakunlanadi. Tafsilotlarni maktabingiz o'qituvchisidan bilib oling.",
        "These steps follow the Hanafi method. In the Hanbali school: the same Thana is recited; Ameen is said aloud in the loud prayers; the hands are raised when going into ruku‘ and when rising from it; ‘Rabbighfir li’ between the two sajdahs is required; and Witr is commonly prayed as two rak‘at and then one, with Qunut after ruku‘. Learn the details from a teacher of your school." to "Bu qadamlar Hanafiy usuliga amal qiladi. Hanbaliy mazhabida: xuddi shu Tana o‘qiladi; Omin, baland ovozda aytiladigan duolarda; rukuga kirganda va undan ko'tarilganda qo'llar ko'tariladi; Ikki sajda orasida “Robbigfir li” vojibdir; Vitr namozi odatda ikki rakat, keyin bir rakat, rukudan keyin qunut bilan o'qiladi. Tafsilotlarni maktabingiz o'qituvchisidan bilib oling.",
