        "Raise both hands to the shoulders, keeping them inside the shawl, and say Allahu Akbar. Then place the right palm over the back of the left hand on the chest." to "Ikki qo'lni yelkaga ko'tarib, ro'mol ichida tuting va \"Allohu Akbar\" deb ayting. Keyin o'ng kaftni chap qo'lning orqa tomoniga ko'kragiga qo'ying.",
